Added the `--gutter` and `--content-spacing` tokens: the room on both sides of the page, and between the content and the header and footer. Added the `DocumentTitle` component, the page title of views without blocks, which renders the title block's markup. A full width block has no gutter, so it uses the whole width. The event view and its details panel have the stable `event-view` and `event-details` classes, for themes to target. @danalvrz
